        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 11.1 - Responsibilities",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                261,
                490,
                289
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    261.0
                ],
                [
                    490.0,
                    261.0
                ],
                [
                    490.0,
                    289.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    289.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. It shall be the responsibility of the Employer and Employee to observe all safety precautions and maintain the standard of safety established in accordance with applicable regulations and safety and occupational health policies.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                321,
                1024,
                408
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    321.0
                ],
                [
                    1024.0,
                    321.0
                ],
                [
                    1024.0,
                    408.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    408.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Parties agree to exert every reasonable effort to provide and maintain a work environment conducive to the safety and well-being of all Employees, and to provide safety and health training for all Employees in accordance with applicable laws, rules, and regulations.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                432,
                1054,
                546
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    432.0
                ],
                [
                    1054.0,
                    432.0
                ],
                [
                    1054.0,
                    546.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    546.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. All rules, laws, and regulations pertaining to safety and health shall be on-hand within the Employees work center and will be adhered to by all Employees.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                570,
                1019,
                628
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    570.0
                ],
                [
                    1019.0,
                    570.0
                ],
                [
                    1019.0,
                    628.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    628.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Hazardous tasks will normally be assigned and performed by Employees who have received appropriate briefings, instructions, and training pertinent to the hazardous tasks to be performed. The performance of hazardous tasks shall incorporate all immediately available safety precautions and devices.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                654,
                1064,
                768
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    654.0
                ],
                [
                    1064.0,
                    654.0
                ],
                [
                    1064.0,
                    768.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    768.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The Union agrees to cooperate in these efforts and encourage Employees to work in a safe manner, obey established safety policies, and directives, and wear the required safety equipment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                793,
                1078,
                878
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    793.0
                ],
                [
                    1078.0,
                    793.0
                ],
                [
                    1078.0,
                    878.0
                ],
                [
                    130.0,
                    878.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The Union shall be allowed to be present at local and state level Safety Council meetings. Management agrees to consider all recommendations of the Union relative to basic policy on safety and health.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                904,
                1079,
                990
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    904.0
                ],
                [
                    1079.0,
                    904.0
                ],
                [
                    1079.0,
                    990.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    990.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. The cleaning and repair of protective clothing and equipment contaminated with or by controlled waste material shall be provided by the Employer.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                1015,
                1055,
                1073
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    1015.0
                ],
                [
                    1055.0,
                    1015.0
                ],
                [
                    1055.0,
                    1073.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    1073.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. The Employer will make every reasonable effort to provide Employees access to personal hygiene facilities. These may include latrine and shower facilities, segregated by gender, that are adequately powered and stocked with supplies, and which have ready access to potable drinking water. When forecasted, the Employer will make available portable latrine, shower, and mobile drinking water units prior to requiring Employees to work out of said locations.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                1099,
                1066,
                1269
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    1099.0
                ],
                [
                    1066.0,
                    1099.0
                ],
                [
                    1066.0,
                    1269.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    1269.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "9. An Employee under the care of a physician shall promptly inform his or her Supervisor of any prescribed medication that his or her physician or pharmacist has advised will impair his or her ability to safely perform assigned work. Information provided by an Employee shall include the limiting effects of the medication and expected duration of prescription. Management shall make every reasonable effort to",
            "block_bbox": [
